From: "Claude (pour Wiem Arfaoui)" <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 12:29:45 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] feat: rewrite project presentation in French from
 verified code and CV

- Present Minassa, SmartDent and the SIGA internship with one consistent
  structure: goal, delivered features, technologies, role, current status, repo
- SmartDent: list only features found in the code (roles, patients, appointments,
  dental chart, payments/PDF, dashboard, messaging, patient portal, AI summary)
- SIGA: shown as an internship; contribution limited to what git history shows
  (tasks module in Spring Boot, task screens and guards in Angular)
- Minassa: only CV-confirmed facts; planned features clearly labelled as goals
- Remove the DevSecOps project (not in CV, no repository)
- Add GitHub links only for repositories that exist and respond
- Translate the whole site to French and replace generic hero copy
